  280                                                        /THE BIN AND RIM LOADER [WITHIN "BIN"]
  281          0000          KMNADR= 0000                    /GENERATION ADDRESS FOR WRITING OUT
  282                                                        /THE KEYBOARD MONITOR AND INTEGRATED EDITOR
  283          0000          KMNFLD= 0^10                    /GENERATION FIELD FOR WRITING OUT
  284                                                        /THE KEYBOARD MONITOR AND INTEGRATED EDITOR
