  290                                                        /IMAGE OF THE BOOTSTRAP AND SLURP LOADER
  291          0010          SLUFLD= 1^10                    /GENERATION FIELD FOR WRITING OUT
  292                                                        /IMAGE OF THE BOOTSTRAP AND SLURP LOADER
