  326                /       A SIMPLE REMEDY CONSISTS MERELY OF REARRANGING EXISTING INSTRUCTIONS.  THE
  327                /       REPAIRED VERSION OCCUPIES THE EXACT SAME MEMORY RANGE AS THE ORIGINAL VERSION;
  328                /       HOWEVER, CERTAIN LOCATIONS WITHIN THE SYSTEM DEVICE HANDLER MUST BE MODIFIED
  329                /       CONSISTENT WITH THE MODIFIED ADDRESSING OF KEY LOCATIONS WITHIN THE HANDLER.
  330   
