  332                /       CORRECTED VERSION.  LEAVE UNCOMMENTED THE APPROPRIATE CHOICE OF EITHER
  333                /       AUTHENTIC ORIGINAL CODE OR THE VERSION REMEDYING THE PROBLEM.  [NOTE: FUTURE
  334                /       RELEASES OF THE SYSTEM DEVICE HANDLER WILL ELIMINATE THE BUG AS WELL AS
