  926                /       CANNOT BE ACCOMPLISHED DIRECTLY FROM THE CODE DEFINED BELOW; THE EXACT
  927                /       MECHANISM USED FOR SYSTEM GENERATION MUST BE LOADED BY SOME MEANS EXTERNAL TO
  928                /       THIS IMAGE; IN ALL LIKELIHOOD THIS WILL BE SOME FORM OF DEVICE HANDLER THAT
  929                /       COLD BE IN CONFLICT WITH THIS CODE.
