 1101                /       P?S/8 CORE SIZE AND STATUS WORD.
 1102   
 1103                /       THE P?S/8 CORE SIZE AND STATUS WORD MANAGES MEMORY AVAILABLE TO ALL P?S/8
 1104                /       UTILITIES AND CONFORMING USER PROGRAMS.  ADDITIONALLY, THE STATUS OF THE
 1105                /       CONSOLE OVERLAY AND SOFTWARE ABORT BITS ARE STORED HERE.
