 2111                /       HAVE CONSTANT VALUE.  AS WRITTEN CURRENTLY, THIS HANDLER DOES NOT VIOLATE THIS
 2112                /       RULE AS ALL LOCATIONS IN THIS RANGE ARE ESSENTIALLY TEMPORARY STORAGE.  ANY
 2113                /       NEW CALL TO THE SYSTEM DEVICE HANDLER WILL INITIALIZE THE REFERENCED LOCATIONS
 2114                /       AS NECESSARY.
 2115   
