 2117                /       ACTUALLY PERFORMING DATA BREAK OPERATIONS SIMULTANEOUSLY.  THIS COULD ONLY BE
 2118                /       AN ISSUE IF SOME INTERRUPT-DRIVEN REAL-TIME MULTITASKING APPLICATION IS
 2119                /       CONTEMPLATED.  MANY HANDLERS ARE NOT CAPABLE OF SUCH OPERATION DUE TO THE
 2120                /       UNCERTAINTY OF THE CONTENTS OF ANY OF THESE LOCATIONS.  AS SUCH, A
 2121                /       LOW-PRIORITY CONSIDERATION OF HANDLER DESIGN IS TO MINIMIZE THE CONSEQUENCES
