 2183                /       P?S/8 TC01/TC08 SYSTEM DEVICE HANDLER IMPLEMENTATION NOTES:
 2184   
 2185                /       1) WHEN THE LOGICAL CONSOLE OVERLAY IS ENABLED,THE SECTIONS OF CODE OVERLAID
 2186                /          BY INTERCEPT ROUTINES MUST BE CAREFULLY IMPLEMENTED.  THE PREVAILING DATA
 2187                /          FIELD WITHIN THE TC01/TC08 SYSTEM DEVICE HANDLER IS THE CALLER'S DATA FIELD
 2188                /          TO ALLOW ACCESS TO THE IN-LINE ARGUMENTS; INTERCEPT ROUTINES MUST PRESERVE
 2189                /          THIS WHEN RETURNING TO THE MAINLINE DEVICE HANDLER CODE.  ACCESS TO THE
 2190                /          CUSTOM OVERSHOOT FACTOR MUST BE MADE WHILE THE DATA FIELD IS TEMPORARILY
 2191                /          SET TO 00; THIS WILL ENSURE ANY MODIFICATIONS TO THE CUSTOM OVERSHOOT
 2192                /          FACTOR ARE ALWAYS APPLIED.
 2193   
