 2195                /          INTO THE CORRESPONDING ELEMENT OF A TABLE ACCORDING TO THE CURRENT LOGICAL
 2196                /          DEVICE UNIT, AND ALSO RETURNING IT TO THE MAINLINE DEVICE HANDLER CODE.  AS
 2197                /          NECESSARY, THE DATA FIELD MAY NEEDED TO BE SET TO THE INSTRUCTION FIELD OF
 2198                /          THE OVERLAY BEFORE BEING RESET TO THE CALLER'S DATA FIELD.


