 2840                /       RESERVED FOR THE DF32/RF08, TC58 SERIES MAGNETIC TAPE CONTROLLER AND THE
 2841                /       TC01/TC08 DECTAPE CONTROLLER.
 2842   
 2843                /       IF AT ALL POSSIBLE, ONLY TEMPORARY DATA SHOULD BE STORED IN THESE SIX WORDS.
 2844   
