 2897                /       OFFICIAL STARTING ADDRESS OF 07777, WHICH IS ACTUALLY A "JMP" INSTRUCTION TO
 2898                /       THE INTERNAL STARTING ADDRESS REGARDLESS OF IMPLEMENTATION.
 2899   
