 3442                /       THE SYSTEM RESTART ENTERS HERE.
 3443   
 3444                /       P?S/8 CONVENTIONS FOR RESTART ARE SIMILAR TO OTHER PDP-8 OPERATING SYSTEM
 3445                /       CONVENTIONS.  CONSIDERATIONS ARE AS FOLLOWS:
 3446   
 3447                /       1) THE DATA FIELD MUST BE 0.
 3448   
 3449                /       2) INTERRUPTS MUST BE DISABLED AS RESTARTING P?S/8 LOADS OVER MOST OF USER
 3450                /          MEMORY INCLUDING THE INTERRUPT-HANDLING LOCATIONS [00000-00001].
 3451   
 3452                /       3) THE AC AND LINK ARE IGNORED.
 3453   
 3454                        IFNZRO  .-7600  <ERROR  .>      /ENSURE BOOTSTRAP COMPATIBILITY.
 3456   
 3457   07600* 7770  SL7770, SPA SNA SZL CLA/7770            /CLEAR THE AC AND POSSIBLY
 3458                                                        /SKIP; ALSO CONSTANT 7770.
 3459   
 3460                /       THE FOLLOWING INSTRUCTION MIGHT BE SKIPPED OR HARMLESSLY EXECUTED AS "AND 30".
 3461   
 3462   07601* 0030  SL30,   30                              /CONSTANT 0030.
 3463   
 3464                /       THE AC IS DEFINITELY CLEAR AT THIS POINT.
 3465                 
 3466   07602* 6774          DTLB                            /ALL DMA TRANSFERS TO FIELD 0.
 3467   07603* 1207          TAD     SL600/(600)             /SETUP FOR REWIND ON UNIT 0.
 3468   07604* 4213          JMS     SLWAIT                  /WAIT FOR REVERSE END ZONE ERROR.
 3469   07605* 1223          TAD     SL7577/(SBOOT-1)        /GET PRE-DECREMENTED POINTER TO RELOAD ADDRESS.
 3470   07606* 3355          DCA     CA                      /STASH IN THE CURRENT ADDRESS REGISTER.
 3471   
 3472                /       THE FOLLOWING INSTRUCTION EXECUTES HARMLESSLY AS "AND I SL7770" [0600].
 3473   
 3474   07607* 0600  SL600,  600                             /CONSTANT 0600.
 3475   
 3476                /       THE NEXT INSTRUCTION EXECUTES HARMLESSLY AS "AND I 0" [0400]; ADDITIONALLY,
 3477                /       IT MUST BE LOCATED AT 7610 TO FORM ANOTHER CONSTANT USED ELSEWHERE.
 3478   
 3479                        IFNZRO  .&177-10        <ERROR  .>
 3481   
 3482   07610* 0400  SL400,  400                             /CONSTANT 0400.
 3483   
 3484   07611* 1237          TAD     SL220/(0220)            /GET READ FORWARD FUNCTION VALUE.
 3485   07612* 4213          JMS     SLWAIT                  /GO WAIT THERE FOR DMA OVERLAY TO TAKE
 3486                                                        /CONTROL AWAY FROM US AND GIVE IT TO THE
 3487                                                        /JUST-READ BOOT-BLOCK CONTENTS.


