 3700                /       EACH DATA WORD TRANSFER WILL BE MONITORED INDIVIDUALLY.  SLURP FILE
 3701                /       PARTICULARS WILL BE DEALT WITH IN REAL-TIME.
 3702   
 3703                /       NOTE: APPENDIX "O" DISCUSSES THE INTERNAL DESIGN OF SLURP FORMAT BINARY FILES.
 3704                /       ALL SLURP DATA WORDS ARE QUICKLY PROCESSED BY THE TIGHTLY CODED SECTION BELOW;
 3705                /       DATA SYNCHRONIZATION IS EASILY ACHIEVED.  SIMILAR IMPLEMENTATIONS HAVE BEEN
 3706                /       WRITTEN FOR THE TD8E SIMPLE DECTAPE CONTROLLER AND OTHER NON-DMA DEVICES.
 3707   
 3708                /       PROCESS THE LATEST BINARY BLOCK IN SLURP FORMAT.
 3709   
 3710   07666* 1340          TAD     SL7756/(-22)            /SETUP THE
 3711   07667* 3352          DCA     GRPCTR                  /GROUP COUNTER.
 3712   07670* 1345  NXTGRP, TAD     SL7772/(-6)             /SETUP THE LATEST
 3713   07671* 3350          DCA     GWRDCTR                 /GROUP WORD COUNTER.
 3714   07672* 4327          JMS     GETWRD                  /GET LATEST GROUP CONTROL WORD.
 3715   07673* 7110          CLL RAR                         /MOVE OVER INITIALLY.
 3716   07674* 7410          SKP                             /DON'T USE PREVIOUS GROUP CONTROL WORD.
 3717   07675* 1342  NXTWRD, TAD     SLPCTRL                 /GET LATEST CONTROL WORD.
 3718   07676* 7006          RTL                             /MOVE OVER TO PROCESS LAST DATA WORD.
 3719   07677* 3342          DCA     SLPCTRL                 /STORE BACK FOR NEXT TIME.
 3720   07700* 1342          TAD     SLPCTRL                 /GET THE UPDATED GROUP CONTROL WORD.
 3721   07701* 7710          SPA CLA                         /SKIP IF DATA OR ORIGIN SETTING.
 3722   07702* 5322          JMP     FLDCHK                  /JUMP IF FIELD SETTING OR END-OF-FILE.
 3723   07703* 4327          JMS     GETWRD                  /GET A FILE WORD
 3724   07704* 6201  SLPFLD, CDF     00+.-.                  /WILL BE "CDF" TO THE LATEST LOADING FIELD.
 3725   07705* 7420          SNL                             /SKIP IF AN ORIGIN SETTING
 3726   07706* 3741          DCA I   SLRPORG                 /STORE DATA WORD.
 3727   07707* 6201          CDF     00                      /BACK TO FIELD 0.
 3728   07710* 2341          ISZ     SLRPORG                 /BUMP TO NEXT LOADING LOCATION.
 3729   07711* 7430          SZL                             /SKIP IF DATA WORD
 3730   07712* 3341          DCA     SLRPORG                 /STORE NEW LOADING ORIGIN.
 3731   07713* 2350  SLPNEXT,ISZ     GWRDCTR                 /FINISHED THIS GROUP?
 3732   07714* 5275          JMP     NXTWRD                  /NO, GO PROCESS NEXT WORD.
 3733   07715* 2352          ISZ     GRPCTR                  /YES, FINISHED ALL GROUPS IN THIS BLOCK?
 3734   07716* 5270          JMP     NXTGRP                  /NO, GO BACK AND DO ANOTHER ONE.


