 3751                /       THIS IS THE HEART OF THE SLURP LOADER.  THREE-CYCLE DATA BREAKS ARE IN
 3752                /       PROGRESS; A 12-BIT DATA WORD IS TRANSFERRED EVERY 133 MICROSECONDS.  EACH
 3753                /       TRANSFER BUMPS UP THE WORD COUNT; HOWEVER, THE WORD COUNT IS SET TO ZERO
 3754                /       BEFORE EACH WORD TRANSFER; THE CURRENT ADDRESS REGISTER IS RESET TO ALWAYS
 3755                /       POINT TO THE SAME MEMORY LOCATION USED AS THE DATA BUFFER.  WAIT FOR THE WORD
 3756                /       COUNT TO CHANGE FROM 0000-0001; THIS INDICATES THE LATEST DATA WORD IS
 3757                /       AVAILABLE.
 3758   
 3759                /       SINCE ALL DATA TRANSFERS ARE WITHIN THE SYSTEM RESERVED SPACE [07600-07777]
 3760                /       THERE ARE NO RESTRICTIONS ON USER SPACE LOADING.
 3761   
 3762                /       NOTE: THIS ROUTINE MUST BE CALLED WITH THE AC CLEAR.
 3763   
 3764   07727* 0000  GETWRD, .-.                             /GET A WORD ROUTINE.
 3765   07730* 3354          DCA     WC                      /CLEAR WORD COUNT REGISTER.
 3766   07731* 1334          TAD     SL7750/(ONEWORD-1)      /GET POINTER TO ONE-WORD BUFFER.
 3767   07732* 3355          DCA     CA                      /STASH IN CURRENT ADDRESS REGISTER.
 3768   07733* 1354  WATLUP, TAD     WC                      /GET CURRENT WORD COUNT REGISTER VALUE.
 3769   07734* 7750  SL7750, SPA SNA CLA                     /SKIP IF IT CHANGED; ALSO CONSTANT 7750.
 3770   07735* 5333          JMP     WATLUP                  /JUMP BACK IF IT HASN'T CHANGED YET.
 3771   07736* 1351          TAD     ONEWORD                 /GET THE LATEST DATA WORD.
 3772   07737* 5727          JMP I   GETWRD                  /RETURN TO CALLER.
 3773   
 3774   07740* 7756  SL7756, 7756                            /CONSTANT 7756.
 3775   07741* 0000  SLRPORG,.-.                             /SLURP LOADER LOADING ORIGIN.
 3776   07742* 0000  SLPCTRL,.-.                             /SLURP GROUP CONTROL WORD.
 3777   
 3778   07743* 0000          ZBLOCK  2                       /EMPTY SPACE!
 3779   
 3780                /       NOTE: FUTURE RELEASES OF THE SLURP LOADER WILL LIKELY USE THESE FREE WORDS.


