 3864                /       THE BUFFER ADDRESS FOR LOADING THE SLURP LOADER MUST BE USED TO CREATE A
 3865                /       PROPER WRITE ROUTINE FOR THE ENTIRE P?S/8 BIN PROGRAM; THE SLURP LOADER IS
