 3867                /       INTERNAL INITIALIZATION CODE MUST REFERENCE THE CODE WHERE LOADED WITHIN BIN
 3868                /       WHICH IS AN ENTIRELY DIFFERENT ADDRESS SPACE THAN THE ONE DEFINED IN THIS
 3869                /       DOCUMENT FOR THE PURPOSES OF SYSTEM GENERATION OR EXECUTION.  IT IS NOT
 3870                /       UNCOMMON FOR CERTAIN ROUTINES TO HAVE MULTIPLE LOADING DEFINITIONS DEPENDING
