              *0200 
 4130   
 4131                        NOPUNCH                         /FOOL THE ASSEMBLER.
 4132   
 4133          0000          FIELD   0                       /WHERE THIS LOADS WHEN EXECUTED.
              *0200 
 4134   
 4135                        ENPUNCH                         /UN-FOOL THE ASSEMBLER.
 4136   
 4137         *7200          *SLIADR                         /GENERATION ADDRESS FOR SLURP RELOAD "FILE".
 4138   
 4139         *7600          RELOC   SBOOT                   /PAGE WHERE EVERYTHING HAPPENS.
 4140   
 4141                /       NOTE: THIS IS AN IMAGE OF A VALID [SHORT] SLURP FILE; HOWEVER, IT DOES NOT
 4142                /       INCLUDE AN ORIGIN TO 0200 AS IS USUALLY THE CASE.  [AS SUCH, WERE IT AN ACTUAL
 4143                /       TFS BINARY FILE, CERTAIN UTILITIES COULD REJECT IT AS INVALID.  SINCE IT IS
 4144                /       ALWAYS THE CONTENTS OF BLOCK 0060, NO FILE SYSTEM ACCESS EXISTS.]
 4145   
