 4157   07760* 4213          JMS     SLWAIT                  /WAIT FOR THE TAPE TO REWIND.
 4158   07761* 1223          TAD     SL7577/(SBOOT-1)        /SETUP THE
 4159   07762* 3355          DCA     CA                      /CURRENT ADDRESS REGISTER.
 4160   
