 4166                                                        /ENOUGH OF THE SYSTEM HANDLER NEEDED.
 4167   07764* 3354          DCA     WC                      /SETUP THE WORD COUNT REGISTER.
 4168   07765* 1237          TAD     SL220/(220)             /GET READ FORWARD COMMAND BITS.
 4169   07766* 6766          DTLA                            /START READING BLOCK 0000.
 4170   07767* 6771          DTSF                            /FLAG UP?
 4171   07770* 5367          JMP     .-1                     /NO, WAIT FOR IT.


/    P?S/8 TC01/TC08 SYSTEM HANDLER  P?S PAL V08I    18-AUG-14  PAGE 83

 4173   07771* 0000          DA^4+DA^4+DA^4+DA^4+DA^4+DA     /CONTROL WORD.
 4174   
 4175         *7771          RELOC   .-1                     /RESET ASSEMBLY ADDRESS.
 4176   
 4177                /       AT THIS POINT, [MOST OF] BLOCK 0000 IS READ IN.  WE CAN ACCESS CONSTANTS
 4178                /       LOCATED WITHIN THE SYSTEM DEVICE HANDLER.
 4179   
