 4329   01342  1040  REWUNLD,TAD     L7770/[7770]            /SETUP THE MAIN
 4330   01343  3305          DCA     RWTEMP                  /TIMEOUT COUNTER.
 4331   01344  1000          TAD     CURUNIT                 /GET THE CURRENT LOGICAL DEVICE UNIT BITS.
 4332   01345  7112          CLL RTR;RTR                     /MOVE TO AC[0-2].
