 4334   01347  1366          TAD     L700/(700)              /ADD REWIND FUNCTION BITS.
 4335   01350  6766          DTLA                            /START THE TAPE REWIND.
 4336   01351  1100          TAD     KBDCHR                  /GET THE COMMAND CHARACTER.
 4337   01352  1064          TAD     L7756/(-22)             /COMPARE TO CONTROL-R.
 4338   01353  7650          SNA CLA                         /SKIP IF NOT CONTROL-R.
 4339   01354  5216          JMP     KBDLUP                  /GO GET MORE KEYBOARD INPUT.
 4340   01355  6771  UNLWAIT,DTSF                            /FLAG UP YET?
