 8246                /     REQUIRE LINE NUMBERS IMPLEMENTED WITHIN THE KEYBOARD MONITOR AND
 8247                /     INTEGRATED EDITOR.  BASIC FILES CONTAIN LINES WHERE THE LINE NUMBER IS
 8248                /     PART OF THE FILE CONTEXT; THE DIGITS OF THE LINE NUMBERS ARE TEXT
 8249                /     CHARACTERS.  ADDITIONALLY, BASIC FILES CONTAIN INTEGRITY CHECK INFORMATION
 8250                /     PARTICULAR TO THE P?S/8 IMPLEMENTATION.]


