 8417   
 8418                / 13) OS/8
 8419   
 8420                /     OS/8 IS THE MOST WELL KNOWN OF LATER MARKETING NAMES OF THE ORIGINAL PS/8
 8421                /     PROJECT STARTED AS A WEEKEND HACK BY RICHARD LARY.  WHILE MANY WILL
 8422                /     ATTRIBUTE THIS MEDIOCRE SYSTEM TO RICHIE, IT IS ACTUALLY THE WORK OF MANY
 8423                /     PEOPLE [ARGUABLY TOO MANY PEOPLE] AND SUFFERS FROM A VARIETY OF WEAKNESSES
 8424                /     TRACEABLE TO POOR DESIGN OR MANAGERIAL INTERFERENCE PREVENTING EVOLVEMENT
 8425                /     OF THE INITIAL DESIGN TO SOMETHING BETTER.  IT WAS NEVER PROPERLY VETTED
 8426                /     BY THE PDP-8 PROGRAMMING COMMUNITY; MANAGEMENT INTERFERENCE EVENTUALLY
 8427                /     PREVENTED CHANGES CAUSING IT TO BECOME ESSENTIALLY FIXATED WITH A LOT OF
 8428                /     LIMITATIONS.  FOR EXAMPLE, THE SYSTEM FILE DATE RECKONING REACHED
 8429                /     EXPIRATION IN 1978, ALTHOUGH A SERIES OF KLUDGES MANAGED TO KEEP MOST
 8430                /     USERS IGNORANT [YET VAGUELY SATISFIED] UNTIL 2001.  BY THAT TIME DEC WAS
 8431                /     NO LONGER MARKETING THE PDP-8 OR ITS DESCENDANTS.
 8432   
 8433                /     OS/8 WAS ALSO ALLOWED TO DEVOLVE INTO SEVERAL INCOMPATIBLE VARIANTS AS
 8434                /     QUICK-FIX ATTEMPTS TO SOLVE VARIOUS HARDWARE COMPATIBILITY PROBLEMS.
 8435                /     WITHOUT MAJOR REDESIGN IT IS QUITE IMPOSSIBLE TO CREATE A UNIFIED SYSTEM
 8436                /     THAT CAN HANDLE ALL OF THE NEEDLESS PROBLEMS THAT AROSE.  SOME OF THESE
 8437                /     VARIANTS ARE KNOWN AS OS/78, OS/278 ETC. AND ASSOCIATEFD WITH VARIOUS
 8438                /     VERSION NUMBERS FOR THE RELEASE.  IN SOME CASES, THESE DISTINCTIONS ARE
 8439                /     MARKETING PLOYS WHILE IN OTHERS IT IS THE DIRECT RESULT OF PRAGMATIC
 8440                /     ATTEMPTS TO RUN ON SPECIFIC MODELS SUCH AS THE DECMATES.  SOME VARIANTS
 8441                /     ARE MORE DYSFUNCTIONAL THAN OTHERS DUE TO A VARIETY OF REASONS, OFTEN
 8442                /     ASSOCIATED WITH BOTH MANAGERIAL AND PROGRAMMER INCOMPETENCE.
 8443   
 8444                /     OS/8 COMMANDS AND INTERNAL STRUCTURE ARE BARELY ACCEPTABLE TO USERS
 8445                /     SEEKING THE GENERAL SENSIBILITIES OF MOST DEC OPERATING SYSTEMS IF VARIOUS
 8446                /     LIMITATIONS ARE ACCEPTED.  TO MANY, THIS IS NOT THE CASE, ESPECIALLY DUE
 8447                /     TO SORE POINT PROBLEMS SUCH AS MODERN TERMINAL CONTROL REQUIREMENTS AND
 8448                /     PROPER HANDLING OF LARGER DISK STORAGE DEVICES, POOR FILE NAMING AND
 8449                /     DATE ISSUES, ETC.  [NOTE: THESE ARE NOT HINDSIGHT ISSUES AS VIRTUALLY ALL
 8450                /     OF THESE PROBLEMS WERE DISCUSSED DURING THE PRODUCT'S ACTIVE DEVELOPMENT
 8451                /     CYCLE.]


