 8501                / 15) P?S
 8502   
 8503                /     P?S IS THE SHORTHAND DESIGNATION FOR THE POLY QUESTION SOCIETY, AN
 8504                /     AMORPHOUS GROUP OF QUESTIONERS ONCE LOCATED AT BROOKLYN POLYTECHNIC
 8505                /     INSTITUTE, 333 JAY STREET, BROOKLYN, NY 11201.  VARIOUS MEMBERS ARE KNOWN
 8506                /     TO HAVE ACHIEVED EXTRAORDINARY FEATS OF COMPUTER PROGRAMMING, OFTEN
